    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cae90f6c2919b938ec2f31f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "取得经典三冠后，鲁道夫象征接着赢得了\n“有马纪念”的优胜。她的下个目标，\n是“天皇赏（春）”的优胜奖牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54e986e5412c71523423491b450f07765e8efcbb128eeee58b6c479bad819fe0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
