    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0215b7ce9718f4b0c7388baa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当她意气风发地回到休息室时，\n遇见了正在等她的气槽。\n但是气槽看起来似乎身体不太舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed1ea17460e7dc485d7d6d53c67ab9d9a2c0c2f0950eab08628c9e95e55ab013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b9a62024c9f47c2c435a50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7597bb2f91214e1d810eaafc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽为了减少鲁道夫象征的负担而逞强，\n鲁道夫象征因此想以会长的身份担起全责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d5872690b54824713a454642175bad77d6045bb9430ed0e22e84abd83071a1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4612d087912dfdcd6163c697",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77039f032290d961bf884ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人由于过度担心对方的状况而产生误解，\n最后没能达成共识，就这样迎向了跨年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "875b5494e174dd0ca091abc80903ea40597d90899492317ead9f18b1b4dbee20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0391751da25a5f83087bc0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・铁杵磨针",
      "source_fingerprint": "447b18a5bc21eb4835b2ac876bc722bbe1876dfafbb6c1772438db96a0b40545",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7255275289100dfaf8c00620",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征没能取得三冠，因此需要达成\n足以取代三冠的成就。她虎视眈眈地将目标\n锁定在“天皇赏（春）”优胜的奖牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "945e2e06475d94fa6a1c46c74034e3c331877a497a499836f1eba51b61920315",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3bf86a138567ebd4589d99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征已经等不及迎向下一场比赛，\n但是在休息室等她的气槽\n却与气势昂然的她完全相反，状况不佳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "718bad9f2b1426cc5cd39c88598f37717fb08090fb5e1093ccf10ada2570fde6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe587f6f6787ff0ddb7a42c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽为了减少鲁道夫象征的负担而逞强，\n鲁道夫象征因此想以会长的身份担起全责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d5872690b54824713a454642175bad77d6045bb9430ed0e22e84abd83071a1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b74054885874b70fcfc33f11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人由于过度担心对方的状况而产生误解，\n最后没能达成共识，就这样迎向了跨年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "875b5494e174dd0ca091abc80903ea40597d90899492317ead9f18b1b4dbee20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
