    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b1e7499dd0978b41147d01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・冥冥之志",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd8b328b3db837bd1d80a4173deefb8f6cce54317d6d5505d6e921ea4379ed0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3fc67c057e3756c1b77949a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征成功赢回了在表演赛失去的名声，\n并且保持着气势将下一场比赛──\n“日本杯”锁定为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a06727ad6c9e35f8add3c4750c3f12ca84e315ded172547d0baa4afe62df659",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08870c5b0f512bd87287fe61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是她与过去不同，\n并没有对自己施加过度的压力，\n而是与训练员绕道去悠哉地喝茶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b91f08bc9aae90b723e32de91dc56ee21d5ead6c3dece6b2d0036fad260cab2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d25932f9bba9d8afa7232b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（春）结束后・光风霁月",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec336378eabd2168831c007794ce8e4fbde9cbc4d252ad5b0feed1a5f6653162",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a571bf87bb4f5a3b6eab5cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征威风凛凛地跑完“日本杯”，\n她想趁着气势尚未消退参加“有马纪念”，\n而鼎鼎大名的丸善斯基也会参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb6e35376c936531ba3a7fe3c3f42d3b0c0fabb4d84dfaf40d1f9c8feec843f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71aee378eeeeab5b895785a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对丸善斯基抱有一丝兴趣的鲁道夫象征\n悄悄地燃起了斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3376a8b911c32283c3a537c622a98169c61f7b76d505907f9e4580d51028abc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a83cd7224c9cf2c205c456",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于后辈渐渐成长茁壮，\n鲁道夫象征感觉比过去沉稳了许多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1bd3d3822219b7ab7fd6c703750ae7d924ea751cb182ebe801545c8b30d03a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b334ee6bcd12a403867aa21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "加上气槽等人希望她能够以最真实的自己\n面对这场比赛，因此她决定在“有马纪念”中\n奔跑时，暂时放下头衔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f8ebf1244a7da9fb1250b25b6b9926c80ea7dfa9f43b9098a13381ef2df6d6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b5275255e3d24642ef18c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本杯结束后・外柔内刚",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eee0e14de0710b6ab7d6dd035673be7bcb85d9345f7bc2bbb42ebd6f57db6f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
