    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f3cb48ae29ee83cd4a128d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜者已定，赞赏如潮。\n身处焦点的鲁道夫象征\n则是与丸善斯基互相肯定对方的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53ded024b29a30c47f6dbf5403e3b6aa7ef8852a25e8acb045beb044c1144505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017434.json",
      "json_path": [
