    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b0eabc6245e1cfc4d104143",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有比赛都结束了。\n赢得七冠的鲁道夫象征无疑证明了\n自己就是“皇帝”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02914930b83227c7e123ced57a95be66c48f67631d1ac3b631e73a6b3cab128c",
