    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bcc2a7911c56f8bef927a9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "头上的皇冠沉甸甸的，感觉并不坏。\n鲁道夫象征与训练员\n盛大地庆祝了宏愿的实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af5bf2b2d70dc89bec20dcec2248e73fdb30de8ca69d54a29476b9dfb71ec64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
